# Build output for every in-repo Tauri mobile plugin. All of it is machine
# generated on each android build and none of it belongs in git:
#
#   .tauri/          the tauri-api Kotlin sources + their Gradle build, copied
#                    in from the tauri crate by tauri-plugin's build script
#   build/           Gradle/Kotlin output: .jar, .dex, .bin, generated Java
#   .gradle/         Gradle's per-project caches
#   local.properties the developer's own SDK path
#
# Each plugin's own android/.gitignore repeats the first two; this file is the
# one that covers a plugin added later whose generated .gitignore is missing.
.tauri/
build/
.gradle/
local.properties
